 a caption, and collect it. Generate a properly oriented half-size version of the photo (using the Linux command-line convert program) When done, the program should leave the following in the directory in which it was invoked. (That is, if you were in foo/ when you invoked album, then all these things go into foo/) a file index.html containing, for each photo: a properly oriented thumbnail a caption a link from the thumbnail to a properly oriented medium-size version of the photo the thumbnails and medium-size versions.","topics":[],"score":1842,"global_rank":387610},{"name":"ilzxc/wyas","owner":"ilzxc","html_url":"https://github.com/ilzxc/wyas","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Haskell","description":"write yourself a scheme (in haskell)","topics":[],"score":1842,"global_rank":387620},{"name":"haysclark/openfl-learning-webgl","owner":"haysclark","html_url":"https://github.com/haysclark/openfl-learning-webgl","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":1,"language":"Haxe","description":"OpenFL port of Learn WebGL","topics":[],"score":1842,"global_rank":387621},{"name":"hirotnk/adventofcode","owner":"hirotnk","html_url":"https://github.com/hirotnk/adventofcode","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Erlang","description":"My quick solutions with Erlang for Advent of Code 2015","topics":[],"score":1842,"global_rank":387627},{"name":"Wallacoloo/lapdock-NUC-mount","owner":"Wallacoloo","html_url":"https://github.com/Wallacoloo/lapdock-NUC-mount","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"OpenSCAD","description":"Brackets to mount a 5th-gen intel NUC to the back of a Motorola Lapdock","topics":[],"score":1842,"global_rank":387633},{"name":"Viktoru/Wordpress-Themes","owner":"Viktoru","html_url":"https://github.com/Viktoru/Wordpress-Themes","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"PHP","description":null,"topics":[],"score":1842,"global_rank":387635},{"name":"y-usuzumi/H-99","owner":"y-usuzumi","html_url":"htt